Package: polifonia
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Polifonia Contributors <info@polifonia.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/Taoshan98/polifonia
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, pulseaudio-utils
Description: Multi-Speaker & Multi-Monitor Audio Unison Engine for Linux
 Polifonia Audio Studio allows broadcasting synchronized audio to multiple
 monitor displays, USB sound cards, and speakers via PipeWire.
